@title: A tab opened a moment after the click is still followed
STEP 1: VERIFY waits for it
    NAVIGATE to @SITE@/tabs.html
    CLICK the 'Open the product later' button
    VERIFY that 'Manul Plush' is present
STEP 2: And so does an action
    SWITCH TO TAB 1
    CLICK the 'Open the product later' button
    CLICK the 'Add to cart' button
    VERIFY that 'In cart: 1' is present
DONE.
